      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Reject reason used with reject(int) to indicate that the user is rejecting this call because they have declined to answer it. This typically means that they are unable to answer the call at this time and would prefer it be sent to voicemail.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telecom/Call#REJECT_REASON_DECLINED" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.telecom.Call.REJECT_REASON_DECLINED</code>.</a></format></para>
